<<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is true>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Ana wanders through your home, checking out the kitchen and cabinets, looking at your mail. Eventually, she even spots an image of Arthur, smiling and happy in a picture.][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She smiles as she looks back at you before she sees something in your face and sets it down.][/nomarkup] #line:0f5d28b
    {$anastasia}: Kind of a shithole, isn't it? #line:0941406
    {$anastasia}: I say we need to get something over the windows or we're going to fucking die. Two birds with one stone? Shower and cover the windows? #line:0a44c33
<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You stand in your home staring at the bills on your counter, the sink dripping a methodical drip of water ][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Looking at the windows, you see the very edge of a light purple along the horizon. Eventually, the sun will rise and even though you don't feel like moving, don't feel like rising unbidden strength comes to you.][/nomarkup] 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You push yourself off the counter with a need to find something to barricade yourself away from the light.][/nomarkup] #line:0297d17
    {$beast}: [nomarkup][You're not dying after one night. Get a grip.][/nomarkup] #line:0b4a2f3
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You find yourself staring out at your empty house, puppeteered by ambition and unable to stop yourself from moving forward.][/nomarkup] #line:0e9c890
